#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:10
msgid ""
"A DRM-free ebook from your computer. EPUB works best; AZW3, MOBI, AZW, "
"FB2 and PDF also work."
msgstr ""
"Un libro sin DRM de tu equipo. EPUB es lo que mejor funciona; también "
"valen AZW3, MOBI, AZW, FB2 y PDF."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:22
msgid "Ebook file"
msgstr "Archivo del libro"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:24
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:65
msgid "Browse…"
msgstr "Examinar…"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:25
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:66
msgid "Nothing chosen yet"
msgstr "Todavía no has elegido nada"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:28
msgid ""
"The file is copied into this app's own folder. Nothing is uploaded "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""
"El archivo se copia a la carpeta propia de esta aplicación. No se sube "
"nada a ninguna parte."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:32
msgid "Narration engine"
msgstr "Motor de narración"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:32
msgid "— you almost certainly want the default"
msgstr "— casi con seguridad quieres el predeterminado"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:35
msgid "Chatterbox — real narration"
msgstr "Chatterbox — narración real"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:36
msgid "Silent — for testing the pipeline"
msgstr "Silencioso — para probar el proceso"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:38
msgid ""
"The silent engine runs the whole process end to end without a GPU, "
"producing a real <code>.m4b</code> of silence. It exists to prove the "
"plumbing works."
msgstr ""
"El motor silencioso recorre todo el proceso de principio a fin sin GPU y "
"produce un <code>.m4b</code> real de silencio. Existe para comprobar que "
"la maquinaria funciona."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:43
msgid "Read this book"
msgstr "Leer este libro"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:44
msgid "Takes a few seconds. Narrating comes after."
msgstr "Tarda unos segundos. La narración viene después."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/new.html:51
msgid ""
"<b>Books you own, without DRM.</b> This cannot open a file bought with "
"copy protection still on it, and it does not try to."
msgstr ""
"<b>Libros tuyos, sin DRM.</b> Esto no puede abrir un archivo comprado con"
" la protección anticopia puesta, y no lo intenta."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:9
msgid "Everything is stored in one folder on this machine."
msgstr "Todo se guarda en una sola carpeta de este equipo."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:10
msgid "Show me what's in it"
msgstr "Muéstrame qué contiene"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:20
msgid "Where finished audiobooks go"
msgstr "Dónde van los audiolibros terminados"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:28
msgid "Not set yet"
msgstr "Todavía sin definir"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:32
msgid ""
"Point this at the folder Plex watches. Each book is filed as <code>Author"
" / Title (Year) / Title.m4b</code> with a <code>cover.jpg</code> beside "
"it — the layout Plex and Audiobookshelf both expect. Any single book can "
"still go to a flat folder instead."
msgstr ""
"Apunta esto a la carpeta que vigila Plex. Cada libro se archiva como "
"<code>Autor / Título (Año) / Título.m4b</code> con un "
"<code>cover.jpg</code> al lado — la disposición que esperan tanto Plex "
"como Audiobookshelf. Cualquier libro concreto puede ir a una carpeta "
"simple en su lugar."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:34
msgid "Choose folder…"
msgstr "Elegir carpeta…"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:36
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Borrar"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:38
msgid "The folder is checked for write access when you save."
msgstr "Se comprueba que se pueda escribir en la carpeta al guardar."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:48
msgid ""
"Narrating a book leaves behind the raw audio of every sentence — a few "
"gigabytes per book. It buys one thing: re-narrating in minutes rather "
"than hours after you change a setting. Once a book sounds right, it is "
"dead weight."
msgstr ""
"Narrar un libro deja el audio en bruto de cada frase — unos cuantos "
"gigabytes por libro. Sirve para una cosa: volver a narrar en minutos en "
"lugar de horas tras cambiar un ajuste. Cuando un libro suena bien, es "
"peso muerto."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:52
msgid "Free them when a book finishes"
msgstr "Liberarlos cuando termine un libro"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:53
msgid ""
"Off by default, so nothing is ever deleted without you. Turn it on and a "
"finished book cleans up after itself."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado de forma predeterminada, así nunca se borra nada sin ti. "
"Actívalo y un libro terminado se limpia solo."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:57
msgid "Review book by book"
msgstr "Revisar libro por libro"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:64
msgid "How hard to work this machine"
msgstr "Cuánto exigirle a este equipo"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:65
msgid "the audiobook is identical either way"
msgstr "el audiolibro es idéntico en cualquier caso"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:79
msgid "Saved as the default for new books. Any single one can override it."
msgstr ""
"Se guarda como predeterminado para los libros nuevos. Cualquiera de ellos"
" puede cambiarlo."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:86
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Aspecto"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:111
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:112
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modo"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:117
msgid ""
"Applies everywhere, including the tray. Match my system follows the "
"light/dark setting of Windows, macOS or your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Se aplica en todas partes, incluida la bandeja del sistema. «Seguir al "
"sistema» respeta el ajuste claro/oscuro de Windows, macOS o tu "
"escritorio."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:122
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Idioma"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:133
msgid ""
"Also used by the menu-bar icon, whose title changes the next time the app"
" starts."
msgstr ""
"También lo usa el icono de la barra de menús, cuyo título cambia la "
"próxima vez que se inicie la aplicación."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:139
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(langs)s are community translations, written without a native speaker's "
"review. Corrections are welcome — the wording lives in <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">the locale files</a>."
msgstr ""
"%(langs)s son traducciones de la comunidad, escritas sin la revisión de "
"un hablante nativo. Se agradecen las correcciones — el texto está en <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">los archivos de idioma</a>."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:146
msgid "Previews"
msgstr "Vistas previas"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:151
msgid "Play a preview as soon as it is ready"
msgstr "Reproducir la vista previa en cuanto esté lista"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:152
msgid ""
"Generating one takes a while, so this saves pressing play after the wait."
" Turn it off if you would rather choose the moment it starts."
msgstr ""
"Generarla lleva un rato, así que esto ahorra pulsar reproducir después de"
" la espera. Desactívalo si prefieres elegir tú el momento."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:159
msgid "Back up your work"
msgstr "Haz una copia de seguridad de tu trabajo"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:162
msgid "What to include"
msgstr "Qué incluir"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:164
msgid "Books and settings — not the audio"
msgstr "Libros y ajustes — sin el audio"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:165
msgid "Settings and voice clips only"
msgstr "Solo los ajustes y los clips de voz"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:166
msgid "Everything, including narrated audio"
msgstr "Todo, incluido el audio narrado"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:173
msgid ""
"Narrated audio is left out on purpose: it is a hundred times the size and"
" any re-render recreates it exactly. What is left is the part that cannot"
" be recreated."
msgstr ""
"El audio narrado se deja fuera a propósito: ocupa cien veces más y "
"cualquier regeneración lo recrea exactamente igual. Lo que queda es lo "
"que no se puede recrear."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:175
msgid "Download backup"
msgstr "Descargar la copia"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:177
msgid "Restore with <code>ebook-audiobook restore &lt;file&gt;.zip</code>."
msgstr "Restaura con <code>ebook-audiobook restore &lt;archivo&gt;.zip</code>."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:182
msgid "Narration languages"
msgstr "Idiomas de narración"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:184
msgid ""
"Books are narrated in English out of the box. Narrating in another "
"language needs a second speech model, about 3 GB, downloaded from "
"huggingface.co when — and only when — you press Install. Each language "
"has its own narrators; a book's page offers the ones that speak its "
"language."
msgstr ""
"De serie, los libros se narran en inglés. Narrar en otro idioma requiere "
"un segundo modelo de voz, de unos 3 GB, que se descarga de huggingface.co"
" cuando —y solo cuando— pulsas Instalar. Cada idioma tiene sus propios "
"narradores; la página de un libro ofrece los que hablan su idioma."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:190
msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Actualizaciones"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:192
msgid ""
"Nothing here contacts the internet on its own. Asking whether there is a "
"newer version means sending a request to GitHub, which carries your IP "
"address — so it happens when you press the button, and not before."
msgstr ""
"Nada de esto se conecta a internet por su cuenta. Preguntar si hay una "
"versión más reciente supone enviar una petición a GitHub, que lleva tu "
"dirección IP — así que ocurre cuando pulsas el botón, y no antes."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:194
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Buscar actualizaciones"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:195
#, python-format
msgid "Running <strong>%(version)s</strong>"
msgstr "Ejecutando la <strong>%(version)s</strong>"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:203
msgid ""
"Off. Turning it on checks here, on this page, and every few hours in the "
"background — a banner appears if there's something newer. Nothing "
"installs on its own: you still choose when, from that banner or from "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado. Al activarlo se comprueba aquí, en esta página, y cada pocas"
" horas en segundo plano — aparecerá un aviso si hay algo más nuevo. Nada "
"se instala solo: sigues eligiendo tú cuándo, desde ese aviso o desde "
"aquí."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:210
msgid "When something goes wrong"
msgstr "Cuando algo va mal"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/settings.html:213
msgid ""
"A report has your home folder replaced with <code>~</code> and book "
"titles removed, so filing one does not publish your reading history."
msgstr ""
"En un informe, tu carpeta personal se sustituye por <code>~</code> y se "
"eliminan los títulos de los libros, así que enviarlo no publica tu "
"historial de lectura."

