msgstr "No hay nada que recuperar sin perder trabajo"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:34
msgid "Nothing to reclaim"
msgstr "Nada que recuperar"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:41
#, python-format
msgid ""
"of the <span class=\"mono\">%(total)s</span> here is raw narration audio "
"from books that are finished, or were only ever previewed."
msgstr ""
"de los <span class=\"mono\">%(total)s</span> que hay aquí es audio de "
"narración en bruto de libros ya terminados, o de los que solo se hizo una"
" vista previa."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:43
msgid ""
"The working files here all belong to books that stopped part-way. They "
"are what lets those books carry on; tick one below only if you would "
"rather narrate it again from the start."
msgstr ""
"Todos los archivos de trabajo que hay aquí pertenecen a libros que se "
"quedaron a medias. Son lo que les permite continuar; marca uno abajo solo"
" si prefieres narrarlo de nuevo desde el principio."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:45
msgid ""
"Every book here is either still being worked on or has already been "
"tidied up."
msgstr "Todos los libros de aquí o siguen en marcha o ya se han limpiado."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:69
msgid "Working files you can free"
msgstr "Archivos de trabajo que puedes liberar"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:71
msgid "Working files holding a resume"
msgstr "Archivos de trabajo que permiten reanudar"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:73
msgid "Finished audiobooks"
msgstr "Audiolibros terminados"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:75
msgid "Your ebooks, voices and choices"
msgstr "Tus libros, voces y decisiones"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:78
msgid "The app itself — its engine and models"
msgstr "La aplicación en sí — su motor y sus modelos"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:82
msgid "Other — temporary files, the window's browser profile"
msgstr "Otros — archivos temporales, el perfil del navegador de la ventana"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:91
msgid "Book by book"
msgstr "Libro por libro"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:111
msgid "safe"
msgstr "seguro"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:113
msgid "in use"
msgstr "en uso"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:123
msgid "What these files are"
msgstr "Qué son estos archivos"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:126
msgid "Raw audio, one piece at a time"
msgstr "Audio en bruto, fragmento a fragmento"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:127
msgid ""
"Every sentence is narrated separately and saved uncompressed, then "
"stitched into chapters and packed into the <code>.m4b</code>. The raw "
"pieces stay behind afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Cada frase se narra por separado y se guarda sin comprimir; luego se unen"
" en capítulos y se empaquetan en el <code>.m4b</code>. Los fragmentos en "
"bruto se quedan después."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:130
msgid "All they buy you is a shortcut"
msgstr "Lo único que te dan es un atajo"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:131
msgid ""
"While they exist, changing a voice setting re-narrates only the parts "
"that changed — minutes instead of hours. Once you are happy with a book, "
"that shortcut is worth nothing."
msgstr ""
"Mientras existan, cambiar un ajuste de voz vuelve a narrar solo las "
"partes afectadas — minutos en lugar de horas. Cuando un libro te "
"convence, ese atajo ya no vale nada."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:134
msgid "You keep everything that matters"
msgstr "Conservas todo lo que importa"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:135
msgid ""
"The finished audiobook, your ebook, your voices, your section choices — "
"untouched. You can always narrate the book again from scratch."
msgstr ""
"El audiolibro terminado, tu libro, tus voces, tus decisiones sobre las "
"secciones — intactos. Siempre puedes volver a narrar el libro desde cero."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:145
msgid "Free them the moment a book finishes"
msgstr "Liberarlos en cuanto termine un libro"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:146
msgid "On — a finished book now cleans up after itself."
msgstr "Activado — ahora un libro terminado se limpia solo."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:147
msgid ""
"Off, so nothing is ever deleted without you. Turn it on and every "
"finished book cleans up after itself."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado, así nunca se borra nada sin ti. Actívalo y cada libro "
"terminado se limpia solo."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:168
msgid "Left switched off."
msgstr "Se ha dejado desactivado."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:179
#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s selected · %(size)s"
msgstr "%(n)s seleccionados · %(size)s"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:180
msgid "nothing selected"
msgstr "nada seleccionado"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:185
msgid "Nothing selected"
msgstr "Nada seleccionado"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:200
#, python-format
msgid "Free up %(size)s?"
msgstr "¿Liberar %(size)s?"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:202
msgid "Delete anyway"
msgstr "Eliminar de todos modos"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:203
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Deletes the raw narration audio for %(n)s book. Finished audiobooks, your"
" ebooks and your voices are untouched."
msgid_plural ""
"Deletes the raw narration audio for %(n)s books. Finished audiobooks, "
"your ebooks and your voices are untouched."
msgstr[0] ""
"Borra el audio de narración en bruto de %(n)s libro. Los audiolibros "
"terminados, tus libros y tus voces no se tocan."
msgstr[1] ""
"Borra el audio de narración en bruto de %(n)s libros. Los audiolibros "
"terminados, tus libros y tus voces no se tocan."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:207
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(n)s of these stopped part-way through. Its working files are what let "
"it carry on — delete them and those sections are narrated again from the "
"beginning."
msgid_plural ""
"%(n)s of these stopped part-way through. Their working files are what let"
" them carry on — delete them and those sections are narrated again from "
"the beginning."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(n)s de estos se quedó a medias. Sus archivos de trabajo son lo que le "
"permite continuar — si los borras, esas secciones se narran otra vez "
"desde el principio."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(n)s de estos se quedaron a medias. Sus archivos de trabajo son lo que "
"les permite continuar — si los borras, esas secciones se narran otra vez "
"desde el principio."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:223
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:225
#, python-format
msgid "Freed %(size)s — %(n)s book was left alone because it is in use"
msgid_plural "Freed %(size)s — %(n)s books were left alone because they are in use"
msgstr[0] "Se liberaron %(size)s — %(n)s libro se dejó intacto porque está en uso"
msgstr[1] ""
"Se liberaron %(size)s — %(n)s libros se dejaron intactos porque están en "
"uso"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:10
msgid ""
"A voice is one short recording. About ten seconds is enough — the engine "
"copies its timbre and reads your whole book in it."
msgstr ""
"Una voz es una grabación breve. Con unos diez segundos basta — el motor "
"copia su timbre y lee todo tu libro con él."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:17
msgid "Which language's narrators to show"
msgstr "Qué narradores mostrar, por idioma"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:24
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:47
msgid "Add a voice"
msgstr "Añadir una voz"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:36
msgid ""
"These narrators can't be auditioned yet: the model for this language "
"isn't on this computer."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no se pueden escuchar estos narradores: el modelo de este idioma "
"no está en este equipo."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:37
msgid "Install it in Settings"
msgstr "Instalarlo en Ajustes"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:43
msgid ""
"<b>Use only voices you have the right to use.</b> Your own recording, or "
"one whose owner has agreed to this. Clips never leave this computer — but"
" that is not the same thing as permission."
msgstr ""
"<b>Usa solo voces que tengas derecho a usar.</b> Una grabación tuya, o "
"una cuyo dueño haya dado su consentimiento. Los clips nunca salen de este"
" equipo — pero eso no es lo mismo que tener permiso."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:51
msgid "Name it"
msgstr "Ponle nombre"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:52
msgid "Warm baritone"
msgstr "Barítono cálido"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:55
msgid "Language it speaks"
msgstr "Idioma que habla"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:63
msgid "Reference clip"
msgstr "Clip de referencia"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:71
msgid ""
"WAV, MP3, FLAC, M4A, MP4, OGG, Opus, AAC or WebM — converted to WAV on "
"the way in. Ten seconds of clear, unaccompanied speech works best."
msgstr ""
"WAV, MP3, FLAC, M4A, MP4, OGG, Opus, AAC o WebM — se convierten a WAV al "
"entrar. Lo que mejor funciona son diez segundos de voz clara y sin "
"acompañamiento."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:72
msgid ""
"The language decides which books can be read in this voice, and which "
"sentence the audition reads back. It is not guessed from the recording."
msgstr ""
"El idioma determina qué libros se pueden leer con esta voz y qué frase se"
" escucha en la prueba. No se deduce de la grabación."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:74
msgid "Add this voice"
msgstr "Añadir esta voz"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:86
msgid "shipped"
msgstr "incluida"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:86
msgid "engine default"
msgstr "predeterminada del motor"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:87
msgid "new books start here"
msgstr "los libros nuevos empiezan aquí"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:90
msgid "ships with the app · public domain"
msgstr "incluida con la aplicación · dominio público"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:91
msgid "the engine’s own voice — no clip"
msgstr "la voz propia del motor — sin clip"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:109
msgid "Needs this language's model — install it in Settings."
msgstr "Requiere el modelo de este idioma — instálalo en Ajustes."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:110
msgid "Audition"
msgstr "Escuchar"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:112
msgid "Use this voice for books you add from now on"
msgstr "Usar esta voz para los libros que añadas a partir de ahora"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:113
msgid "Use for new books"
msgstr "Usar en los libros nuevos"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:118
#, python-format
msgid "Delete “%(name)s”?"
msgstr "¿Eliminar «%(name)s»?"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:119
msgid "Books already narrated with it are unaffected."
msgstr "Los libros ya narrados con ella no se ven afectados."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:164
msgid "Rendering…"
msgstr "Generando…"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:172
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:192
msgid "Couldn't render a sample"
msgstr "No se pudo generar una muestra"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:183
msgid "Still waiting — a render is ahead of it. Try again once that finishes."
msgstr ""
"Sigue esperando — hay una generación por delante. Inténtalo de nuevo "
"cuando termine."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:191
msgid "Sample ready — press play to hear it"
msgstr "Muestra lista — pulsa reproducir para escucharla"

